"P836285581" "You've collected the amulets of Corax from the Circle of Thorns. You should give them to Ashley before they take any more of a hold over you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3152422847" "The amulets of Corax. With these we should be able to see into the past and discover the origin of power that still guides us today.<br><br>You seem agitated. Did you look into these amulets? I warned you against it. I hope you still have some of your sanity. There's plenty of work to be done and the last thing I need is you getting locked up in the nut house."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P34899279" "You did good on that last job, but now it's time for me to level with you. I'm with the <color orange>Midnight Squad</color>. Our history is long and complex, but all you need to know now is that we're going after the Rikti in a big way. We don't have the man power like the Vanguard, but with our knowledge, we don't need it. I'm personally investigating the Rikti and the Lost connection. Are you up for lending me a hand? I know it's not your usual smash and grab, but something interesting might come up."
// AcceptString :
"P3931569460" "Investigate Rikti"
// SendOffString :
"P3138938136" "I've gotten a coded message from one of my fellow Midnighters. The Rikti are up to something concerning the Lost and magic. This concerns us greatly. The Lost have always been the Rikti fan boys, but there's something more going on here.<br><br> <color orange>I was told to send in my most disposable acolyte to gather whatever information they could find.</color> <br><br>Honestly, that's you. But you did so well on that last mission, I'm not too worried about you getting killed by the Rikti. So, if you want to be a part of the Midnight Squad, consider this part of your initiation fee."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3655078472" "Get information"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3678832968" "I still need you to track down what the Rikti are doing with the Lost. I've gotten as much information on my own as I can.<br><br>There's a Lost group holed up in a warehouse around here. Go there and 'collect' whatever information you can in whatever method you use to collect it."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1253640717" "The Rikti are using the Lost for some purpose. You have to determine what that is. Taking out Rikti is simply a side benefit."

