// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2794989421" "I just got word that the Rikti and the Circle of Thorns are fighting in one of the recently discovered ancient catacombs. The coded message I received says that the Rikti and the Thorns are looking for something. Well, the Midnight Squad wants it, too.<br><br>You up for a little smash and grab?"
// AcceptString :
"P2422753964" "Go after the Thorns and the Rikti"
// SendOffString :
"P891193692" "There are two powerful beings of magic and science fighting it out deep underground. {Rikti_Boss_Name} is leading the charge the Circle of Thorns and someone or something known as {CoT_Boss_Name} is fighting back.<br><br><color orange>You're going to need to take out these two in order to get whatever it is they have found.</color><br><br>I've gotten confirmation from my keepers. If you complete this and get us whatever it is that they're fighting over, you will be made a member of the <color Orange>Midnight Squad</color>."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2271149520" "You still have to take {CoT_Boss_Name} and {Rikti_Boss_Name} out. You're going to have to bring back whatever it was that they were fighting over as well. Without that, there's no way you'll be brought into the fold of the Midnighters."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1224468182" "<color deepskyblue>Finale</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1766763847" "The Rikti and the Circle of Thorns are searching for something in these ancient caves. The Midnighters want whatever it is for themselves."

