// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1215042146" "The Nymphus Visage... But I thought it was lost. Where did they get this from? Have you looked through it? Montague tells me that those who look through it see their own future. What did you see, {HeroName}?<br><br>With this mask you have proven yourself a worthy member of the Midnight Squad. <color orange>You can now access the Midnighter Club. This door behind me is not the entrance to the club, but it will lead you there.</color>"

